# Unyielding Gatekeeper: "If you controlled it, return it to the battlefield tapped" (CR 110.2a, 400.7): control, not ownership,
# decides. Bot1 casts the Gatekeeper face down on turn 1 with three Moxen, takes Bot2's Ornithopter with Steal Artifact on turn 3
# (Black Lotus for blue, Mox Ruby for the generic), then turns the Gatekeeper up for {1}{W} (Mox Pearl, Mox Sapphire) and exiles it.
# Bot1 controlled it, so nobody gets a Detective, and since the ability tells Bot1 to return it, it returns tapped under Bot1's
# control (not its owner's), a new object: Steal Artifact (Bot1's) is in the graveyard and Bot2 has nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Unyielding Gatekeeper
Black Lotus
Steal Artifact
Mox Emerald
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

